OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FHeavy rain
OL,6,Fand hill fog pushes northeastwards
OL,7,Fwith Storm Austen. Gusty at coasts and
OL,8,Fover high ground overnight, then gales
OL,9,Freach the southwest of the country
OL,10,Faround dawn.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FRain pushes northeastwards and
OL,13,Fstrong winds become more widespread
OL,14,Fthrough the day with gales in coastal
OL,15,Fareas. Drier and brighter in the
OL,16,Fsouthwest from mid-afternoon, but
OL,17,Fremaining windy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
